     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"line-break:after-white-space\">\r\n<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"c50\">\r\n<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"c231\">\r\n<div><font face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Hi </span>D-RUG<span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">gies! </span><br>\r\n</font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\"><br>\r\n</font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\">We&#39;ll be meeting from 10-noon in the Datalab classroom (360 Shields library) this Wednesday. This is a group working session so come with your questions for our expeRts, or just bring your laptop and get in some distraction\r\n free R-coding time. This is a hybrid meeting so you can also join us via Zoom at this link: <a href=\"https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/96397082218?pwd=S0JXcW5hcUFkbTcwMHFQV1NVNkg3Zz09\" title=\"https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/96397082218?pwd=S0JXcW5hcUFkbTcwMHFQV1NVNkg3Zz09\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(0,134,240)\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/96397082218?pwd%3DS0JXcW5hcUFkbTcwMHFQV1NVNkg3Zz09&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464599771000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3jZy40MQbYcqWkFjKUsb1r\">https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/96397082218?pwd=S0JXcW5hcUFkbTcwMHFQV1NVNkg3Zz09</a></font></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div><font face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\"><br>\r\n</font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\">Please consider posting your questions to our <a href=\"https://d-rug.discourse.group/\" title=\"https://d-rug.discourse.group/\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(0,134,240)\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://d-rug.discourse.group/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464599771000&amp;usg=AOvVaw28l0hnoSMEfvZiT5VlsST1\">Discourse</a> site in advance\r\n of attending D-RUG virtually. This helps us do a better job of answering your questions, and also keep a log of the types of questions we